    <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/담양_메타세쿼이아길"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
    >가로수길</rdfs:label>                                        </관광명소종류>
