                            <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/지산샛강생태공원"/>
                            <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/여의도_샛강생태공원"/>
                            <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/안터생태공원"/>
                            <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/태화강_국가정원"/>
                            <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/순천만"/>
