                                    <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/금오도_비렁길"/>
                                    <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/도째비골_스카이밸리"/>
                                    <관광명소종류_관광명소 rdf:resource="http://sight.eventpool.kr/resource/거제_해금강"/>
